# FitPlan has no root-level environment file. Each app keeps its own example:
#
#   apps/api/.dev.vars.example   ->  copy to apps/api/.dev.vars   (Worker secrets and vars; read by `wrangler dev`)
#   apps/mobile/.env.example     ->  copy to apps/mobile/.env     (EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL for the Expo app)
#
# Secrets belong only in apps/api/.dev.vars (local) or Cloudflare secrets (`wrangler secret put`).
# Never commit .dev.vars or .env. See README.md for the full local setup.
